them we've been able to track back to Saudi

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:32.210
Arabia.

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:38.249
So some of the questions I asked you last
time and the answers were some form of we're

00:01:38.249 --> 00:01:43.569
looking into that include what do we know
about what American authorities know about

00:01:43.569 --> 00:01:50.550
this? What do we know about the sort of, um,
uh, of financial or, or sort of sociopolitical

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:54.549
