And so it sort of to try to understand the

00:01:54.549 --> 00:01:59.409
contours of what may be going on. What have
you learned as your investigation has continued

00:01:59.409 --> 00:02:01.079
since we last talked about this?

00:02:01.079 --> 00:02:06.950
Yeah. A good place to sort of start with that
question is to just sort of stay out front

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:12.659
that what got us looking into these cases
originally was a single case here in Portland

00:02:12.659 --> 00:02:19.080
where we learn that federal law enforcement
who looked into a Saudi national here in Portland,

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:25.530
who disappeared before his manslaughter trial
