00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:55.360
that's what got us looking into whether or
not there are other cases like this one here

00:02:55.360 --> 00:03:00.799
in Oregon and around the country. And in the
last few months, we have now documented nearly

00:03:00.799 --> 00:03:07.879
30 cases where, uh, similar, uh, similar circumstances
have unfolded.

00:03:07.879 --> 00:03:13.470
And so one of the questions we've been raising
from the beginning is whether or not the Saudi

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:19.870
Arabian government might be involved in more
of these uh, escapes. And also the question

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:25.819
of has the u s government known about this?
