00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:17.250
prosecution,

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:25.220
correct. Uh, what we, what we're able to find
is that back in 2008 analysts with the Department

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:31.470
of Homeland Security began looking into a
number of cases that had come up or come to

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:37.250
their attention where a Saudi nationals, mostly
