time you've not found evidence of that. Is

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:50.870
that correct?

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:52.170
Well, what do you mean by complicity?

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:56.780
Well, I dunno. What do you, what, what should,
I mean, in other words, is there anything

00:05:56.780 --> 00:06:02.600
