the Saudi Arabian government, an ally of the
u s about this issue.

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:16.760
Do you have, uh, what, what are the logistics
at, at the sort of individual case level?

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:21.300
In other words, do you have reason to believe
