00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:45.930
Right. So, uh, I think to answer that question,
the first thing we, that we have to sort of

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:51.950
point out or illustrate is that, uh, there
has been a tremendous influx in the number

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:57.900
